2026-10-05  mb6ockatf

	Initial version.

	* configure.ac, Makefile.am, bootstrap: Autotools build with gnits
	strictness, C++23, --enable-static-libstdcxx and
	--enable-static-deps.
	* src/app.cpp, src/source.cpp, src/tui.cpp, src/http.cpp,
	src/config.cpp, src/util.cpp, src/main.cpp: Core: screen rotation,
	lazy cached sources, drawing helpers, HTTP, configuration.
	* src/machines.cpp, agent/raspdash-stats.sh: Machines screen.
	* src/tasks.cpp, src/auth_main.cpp: Google Tasks screen and the
	raspdash-auth OAuth helper.
	* src/timetable.cpp: ruz.spbstu.ru timetable screen.
	* src/weather.cpp: MET Norway weather screen.
	* src/markets.cpp: Market charts screen.
	* config.example.toml: Example configuration.
	* deploy/: Kiosk launcher, alacritty configuration, autostart
	entry, Pi installer, host authorization helper, plan for building
	the libraries on the Pi.
	* hooks/pre-commit: Format C++ with astyle --style=gnu.
	* doc/: Texinfo manual.
	* tests/: make check tests and saved API responses.
